8
00:00:29,586 --> 00:00:31,484
There are three main benefits.

9
00:00:31,484 --> 00:00:34,647
It immediately hydrates to quench dehydrated skin.

10
00:00:34,647 --> 00:00:38,253
It gives hydration that lasts through the day and beyond.

11
00:00:38,253 --> 00:00:40,530
And it replenishes skin from within.

12
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:44,296
The first key ingredient is hyaluronic acid.

13
00:00:44,296 --> 00:00:49,732
This serum uses an enhanced form of hyaluronic acid that penetrates the skin's

14
00:00:49,732 --> 00:00:51,613
