16
00:00:55,854 --> 00:00:59,658
It replenishes the skin's hydration reserves from within.

17
00:01:00,358 --> 00:01:01,497
Now, how to use it.

18
00:01:01,497 --> 00:01:02,816
Start with clean skin.

19
00:01:02,816 --> 00:01:04,795
Cleanse your face and neck first.

20
00:01:05,495 --> 00:01:06,199
