24
00:01:16,772 --> 00:01:18,718
Smooth it over your face and neck.

25
00:01:18,718 --> 00:01:21,636
There's no need to rub hard; just spread it evenly.

26
00:01:22,336 --> 00:01:24,472
Then follow with your moisturizer.

27
00:01:24,472 --> 00:01:28,117
The serum goes on first, and your moisturizer goes on top.

28
00:01:28,817 --> 00:01:32,962
Use it twice a day, morning and night, as part of your regular routine.

29
00:01:32,962 --> 00:01:36,348
It's made to give hydration that lasts throughout the day.

30
00:01:37,048 --> 00:01:41,817
If you have sensitive skin, you can use it, but you may want to patch test first.

31
00:01:41,817 --> 00:01:45,880
Some people may notice a subtle scent from the botanical ingredients.

32
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:50,519
